ply
format ascii 1.0
comment tiny synthetic RadFoam fixture for tests (ASCII)
comment element vertex:
comment  - 4 points forming a unit square on z=0
comment  - density is small but non-zero
comment  - adjacency_offset provides CSR offsets[i+1]
comment  - red/green/blue are preview colors (used to approximate DC in loader)
comment  - color_sh_* contains SH-rest (degree 1 => (1+1)^2=4 comps; rest = 3*(4-1)=9 floats)
element vertex 4
property float x
property float y
property float z
property uchar red
property uchar green
property uchar blue
property float density
property uint adjacency_offset
property float color_sh_0
property float color_sh_1
property float color_sh_2
property float color_sh_3
property float color_sh_4
property float color_sh_5
property float color_sh_6
property float color_sh_7
property float color_sh_8
comment element adjacency: flattened neighbor indices
element adjacency 12
property uint adjacency
end_header
